# A service image is built from the repository root because its `go.mod` replaces the contracts
# module with a path inside this monorepo (compose.yaml). Nothing outside `backend/` belongs in a
# build, and neither does a secret, a VCS artefact or a local tool directory.
.git
.DS_Store
.agents
.qoder
.specify
AGENTS.md
LICENSE
Makefile
compose.yaml
deploy/
specs/
**/.env*
**/vendor/
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/coverage*
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
